						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWreRPlgMg7fo=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"left": 224,
							"top": 16,
							"width": 298.2177734375,
							"height": 40,
							"text": "start方法用来开启子线程的运行\n这意味着需要在其中调用pthread_create函数"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWreRPtgMj9pQ=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWreRPlgMg7fo="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWreIikAKODY4="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "371:71;371:56"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWrechoQNZDV0=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"left": 432,
							"top": 256,
							"width": 459.41015625,
							"height": 40,
							"text": "子线程的入口函数是不能作为接口存在的，所以应该设计为私有的private,\n即Thread创建的对象不能直接调用start_routine"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWrechxQNc2Pk=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWrechoQNZDV0="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWreIikAKODY4="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "484:196;616:255"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWremetwN9a5Y=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"left": 384,
							"top": 352,
							"width": 521,
							"height": 55,
							"text": "子线程开始运行之后，就应该去执行一个任务，但该任务不确定是什么任务，\n那就应该用一个纯虚函数来进行抽象，我们采用run()来表示，该函数的调用\n应该就在start_routine函数内部进行"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWreme1wOAWGk=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWremetwN9a5Y="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWreIikAKODY4="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "456:218;611:351"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLClassView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWreue4QOZDiw=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAFF+qBtyKM79qY="
							},
							"model": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWreue4AOXpLw="
							},
