							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWr0D9Q7WbOMk="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWrzZ8AK9cgA0="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "152:207;137:159"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWr0GIN7bd2T8=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWrzUC7q7kPOo="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"left": 664,
							"top": 96,
							"width": 233,
							"height": 55,
							"text": "消费者需要从任务队列中取数据，\n需要调用pop函数，因此需要知道\n任务队列的存在"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteLinkView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWr0GIWrbp9D8=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWrzUC7q7kPOo="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"head": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWr0GIN7bd2T8="
							},
							"tail": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWrzZ/q6+F4us="
							},
							"lineStyle": 1,
							"points": "760:199;773:151"
						},
						{
							"_type": "UMLNoteView",
							"_id": "AAAAAAGWr0Ox47vs2Gs=",
							"_parent": {
								"$ref": "AAAAAAGWrzUC7q7kPOo="
							},
							"lineColor": "#fb0303",
							"font": "Courier New;13;0",
							"left": 56,
							"top": 504,
							"width": 381.40380859375,
							"height": 145,
							"text": "生产者和任务队列的关系是什么？\n首先不可能是继承关系，因为无法表达A is B的关系\n其次，也没有整体与局部的关系，不可能是组合和聚合的关系\n然后，可以是依赖关系吗？如果是，就意味着需要通过\nrun方法来完成。而现在run方法无法改变参数，\n因为是一个纯虚函数，已经被固定死了。那能够在run方法内部\n创建TaskQueue的对象吗？不行，TaskQueue只有一个。\n也没有静态方法可以使用，这意味着依赖关系不行。\n最后只剩下一个关联关系"
						},
